# Copy to agent/.env and fill in. Never commit the real .env (it is git-ignored).

# --- Gmail (free). Needs 2-Step Verification on, then https://myaccount.google.com/apppasswords
SMTP_USER=you@gmail.com
SMTP_APP_PASSWORD=xxxx xxxx xxxx xxxx
# Alerts only ever go to this address (defaults to SMTP_USER)
EMAIL_TO=you@gmail.com

# --- Your sizing (used for position size and the 1% risk rule)
CAPITAL=500000
RISK_PCT=1.0
BROKER=zerodha

# --- What to watch. Movers on NSE are scanned automatically; these are always checked.
# WATCHLIST=RELIANCE,TCS,HDFCBANK
# Stocks you already hold: you get risk alerts (sharp drop on volume, loss of the 50-day SMA)
# HOLDINGS=INFY,ITC

# --- Optional: free Gemini key (https://aistudio.google.com/apikey) to summarise news in plain English.
# Without it the agent still works; it just lists headlines. Numbers never come from the LLM.
# GEMINI_API_KEY=
# GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-2.0-flash

# --- Futures & options (NIFTY and BANKNIFTY, plus the stocks from your watchlist/holdings whose F&O open
# interest moves most). Without the Angel One block below it uses NSE's public website data, so run it
# from your Mac or home, not GitHub Actions.
# FNO_ENABLED=1
# FNO_UNDERLYINGS=NIFTY,BANKNIFTY
# FNO_INTERVAL_MIN=20
# FNO_STOCKS_PER_SCAN=3
# MAX_FNO_IDEAS_PER_DAY=4

# --- Optional but recommended: Angel One SmartAPI (free with an Angel One account) for official, near-real-time
# F&O quotes, IV and open interest. Create an app at https://smartapi.angelone.in (My Apps) to get the API key,
# and enable TOTP at https://smartapi.angelone.in/enable-totp to get the secret key shown beside the QR code.
# The PIN is your 4-digit Angel One MPIN. Keep this file private: it is git-ignored, never commit it. The agent
# only reads market data and never calls an order endpoint. FNO_SOURCE: auto (Angel One if set, NSE website as
# backup), angel (Angel One only) or nse (website only).
# ANGEL_API_KEY=
# ANGEL_CLIENT_CODE=
# ANGEL_PIN=
# ANGEL_TOTP_SECRET=
# FNO_SOURCE=auto

# --- Limits (defaults shown)
# MAX_EMAILS_PER_DAY=15
# MAX_IDEAS_PER_DAY=8
# MAX_IDEAS_PER_SCAN=3
# SCAN_INTERVAL_MIN=15
# NEWS_INTERVAL_MIN=20
# INBOX_INTERVAL_MIN=10

# Print emails instead of sending (also: python -m nse_agent once --dry-run)
# DRY_RUN=1
